From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@siol.net>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 03:46:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 207/208] avcodec/h263dec: detect MPEG-4 encoder bugs before
 get_format()

ff_mpeg4_workaround_bugs() runs after the pixel format and with it the
hwaccel are chosen for the first picture. A hwaccel which has to tell
the hardware about encoder bugs, or fall back to software when the
hardware cannot reproduce them, cannot know them in its init().

Run it before h263_get_format(). It only depends on the headers parsed
so far and the IDCT setup it may change is done by ff_h263_decode_init().

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@siol.net>
---
 libavcodec/h263dec.c | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libavcodec/h263dec.c b/libavcodec/h263dec.c
index c4a828862a..018eb5aae6 100644
--- a/libavcodec/h263dec.c
+++ b/libavcodec/h263dec.c
@@ -501,6 +501,12 @@ int ff_h263_decode_frame(AVCodecContext *avctx, AVFrame *pict,
         return ret;
     }
 
+#if CONFIG_MPEG4_DECODER
+    /* before h263_get_format(): hwaccels check the workarounds in init() */
+    if (avctx->codec_id == AV_CODEC_ID_MPEG4)
+        ff_mpeg4_workaround_bugs(avctx);
+#endif
+
     if (!h->c.context_initialized) {
         avctx->pix_fmt = h263_get_format(avctx);
         if ((ret = ff_mpv_common_init(s)) < 0)
@@ -513,7 +519,6 @@ int ff_h263_decode_frame(AVCodecContext *avctx, AVFrame *pict,
     if (avctx->codec_id == AV_CODEC_ID_MPEG4) {
         if (h->c.pict_type != AV_PICTURE_TYPE_B && h->c.mb_num/2 > get_bits_left(&h->gb))
             return AVERROR_INVALIDDATA;
-        ff_mpeg4_workaround_bugs(avctx);
         if (h->c.studio_profile != (h->c.idsp.idct == NULL))
             ff_mpv_idct_init(s);
     }
